/*
      x: 1001 1010  1100 1011 1101  1111
x & ~ x: 0001 0010  0100 0001 0001  0001
    sum: 1010 1100 10000 1100 1100 10000

####### Attention #######
S | (1 << i) -> S union {i}
S & ~(1 << i) -> S - {i}

# inclusion-exclusion principle
|U[i = 1 to n] Ai| = sum[i = 1 to n] |Ai| - sum[i < j]|Ai ^ Aj| + ... + (-1)^(n - 1) |^[i = 1 to n]Ai|
